          <span class="bg-[#FF5A1F] text-white px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">
            Where to Buy
          </span>
          <span class="bg-green-500 text-white px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">
            Updated October 2026
          </span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-white leading-tight mb-8">
          Scheels Treadmills: <span class="text-[#5AA9FF]">What to Know Before You Buy</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Scheels is a large, employee-owned sporting goods chain with a serious fitness department, and in some stores you can stand on a premium treadmill you would otherwise only see online. Here is what it sells, how delivery and returns actually work for a machine that arrives on a freight truck, and how its price match applies.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
          <a href="#brands" class="bg-[#FF5A1F] hover:bg-[#E64F16] text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-black no-underline transition-colors uppercase tracking-widest text-sm">
