        </p>
        <div class="ml-auto">
          <SocialProof users="1.1k" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="not-prose my-10 bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 m-0 leading-relaxed">
          <strong class="text-gray-900">On the details below.</strong> This site is independent and not
          affiliated with Scheels or any brand it sells. Brands, policies and figures were checked on
