          <a href="#assembly" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">6. Does Scheels Assemble Treadmills?</a>
          <a href="#returns" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">7. What Is Scheels' Return Policy on Treadmills?</a>
          <a href="#price-match" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">8. Does Scheels Price Match Treadmills?</a>
